WEBVTT

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:10.670
Yes, thank you for all that you've done.

00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:14.920
Yes, Saturday from 2 to 4 should be fine.

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:19.510
Yes. Ah, of course. Thank you so much.

00:01:54.750 --> 00:01:56.950
Good morning.

00:01:57.830 --> 00:02:04.020
While I was at the salon, I heard that there's a mysterious gifted witch apprentice.

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:06.140
Mysterious gifted witch apprentice?

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:11.270
Yes, she's taken just three exams, but skipped a level after each.

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:12.970
What!?

00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:17.420
So you're telling me she's at level 4 after only three exams?

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:19.160
I'm so envious!

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:21.940
Not only that, she passed with a perfect score each time.

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:26.120
If only she was my apprentice.

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:29.080
Why?

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:32.840
Why must it be this way!?

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:40.840
The Transfer Student is a Witch Apprentice!?

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:46.350
Okay, everyone.

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:48.340
Line up, line up.

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:49.520
Don't push.

00:02:50.090 --> 00:02:51.070
What's going on?

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:56.860
I have prepared signed photographs of the famous actress, Tamaki Reika, for everyone.

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:58.400
Famous actress?

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:04.280
My papa's company is sponsoring a movie.

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:06.450
Of course, I'm going to be the heroine.

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:12.320
Tamaki Reika is debuting on the big screen!

00:03:13.530 --> 00:03:14.590
Is she for real?

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:15.960
Is it a horror movie?

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:17.520
Is she playing a ghost?

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:18.940
Reika the ghost!

00:03:18.940 --> 00:03:20.820
Shut up!

00:03:21.630 --> 00:03:24.560
The title is "Love's Call."

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:26.840
It's a romance movie.

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:28.000
A Shorty's Call?

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:29.480
A Child's Teriyaki? (Same pronounciation)

00:03:29.480 --> 00:03:30.460
An Idiot's Face?

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:33.450
"Love's Call," I said!

00:03:33.450 --> 00:03:38.900
Well, in a year, these photographs will be super expensive.

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:43.210
I'd rather have Segawa Onpu-chan's photograph.

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:48.700
Segawa Onpu is out of style already.

00:03:53.510 --> 00:03:57.610
Before class, I would like to introduce all of you to a new friend.

00:03:57.610 --> 00:03:58.670
Come in, Segawa.

00:03:58.670 --> 00:03:59.580
Okay.

00:04:07.190 --> 00:04:09.570
Eh? Segawa Onpu-chan?

00:04:09.570 --> 00:04:11.000
Is she the real deal?

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:13.460
She's just a look-alike.

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:15.680
Okay, do a self-introduction.

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:17.250
Yes, ma'am. Of course.

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:19.620
Um, my name is...

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:24.860
Segawa Onpu!

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:27.370
She's the real deal!

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:33.440
Didn't I tell you already? Don't treat school like showbiz.

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:35.040
One more time.

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:38.650
Whoopsies, whoopsies.

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:40.810
Lovely!

00:04:40.810 --> 00:04:42.550
She's doing this on purpose!

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:47.580
Then, one more time.

00:04:47.580 --> 00:04:49.270
I'm Segawa Onpu.

00:04:49.270 --> 00:04:54.230
I may be absent because of work and such, but I hope to get along with everyone.

00:04:55.730 --> 00:05:01.570
Everyone, just because Segawa is an actress, don't treat her differently from other students.

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:06.370
At school, you have to treat her as a part of the class.

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:08.100
Yes, ma'am!

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:10.770
Your seat is over there, next to Senoo.

00:05:10.770 --> 00:05:11.210
Okay.

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:15.100
I'm Senoo Aiko. Nice to meet'cha.

00:05:15.100 --> 00:05:17.130
Ah, so you're Ai-chan.

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:20.370
Then you are Doremi-chan.

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:22.170
And you are Hadzuki-chan, right?

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:24.170
How do you know us?

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:25.950
Um...

00:05:26.740 --> 00:05:28.510
I heard from Seki-sensei.

00:05:29.890 --> 00:05:30.790
Makes sense.

00:05:30.790 --> 00:05:31.680
Of course.

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:35.940
I heard that you girls help out at a store called the Maho-dou.

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:41.950
Because she's an actress, she has more power than Tamaki.

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:43.490
That feels pretty nice.

00:05:43.490 --> 00:05:44.410
Yeah, really.

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:46.350
No wonder she's popular.

00:05:46.350 --> 00:05:47.700
Hey, class has started already.

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:51.780
Hey, Onpu-chan.

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:56.030
Since you're an actress, do you eat steak every day?

00:05:58.060 --> 00:05:59.460
D-Doremi-chan.

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:06.840
Harukaze, I'll have you answer the first question.

00:06:06.840 --> 00:06:08.870
Why me?

00:06:09.890 --> 00:06:14.330
I really am the world's unluckiest pretty girl!

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:20.280
Segawa-san!

00:06:20.280 --> 00:06:21.040
Onpu-chan!

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:21.920
Please give me your autograph!

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:23.190
Okay, okay.

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:26.020
Didn't y'all listen to Seki-sensei?

00:06:26.020 --> 00:06:27.000
Yeah!

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:30.540
Don't treat her like an actress, treat her like a classmate!

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:32.040
Oh, it's okay.

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:36.510
I'm more than willing to give autographs to people who want to be my friend.

00:06:36.510 --> 00:06:38.480
Ah, here, please stand in a line.

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:41.900
What's with that attitude?

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:45.770
I have as much sense and style as her!

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:50.960
Goodbye, teacher!

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:52.210
Okay, goodbye.

00:06:53.160 --> 00:06:56.290
Boys, stop clinging to Segawa.

00:06:56.290 --> 00:06:57.020
Got it?

00:06:57.020 --> 00:06:58.480
Yes ma'am...

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:02.480
Hey, Onpu-chan, where do you live?

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:05.320
Um, near Misora Park.

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:08.250
That's near the Maho-dou.

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:09.650
Can we come over to play some time?

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:10.950
Sure.

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:13.620
Oh? Then how about this Sunday?

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:15.210
Ah, I'm sorry.

00:07:15.210 --> 00:07:17.820
I have a movie audition this Sunday.

00:07:17.820 --> 00:07:20.080
Did you say an audition!?

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:22.040
What's wrong, Tamaki Reika?

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:26.500
Is your audition for "Love's Call," perhaps?

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:28.630
Yes, do you know of it?

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:38.060
Segawa-san, even if you take part in the audition, you'll never make the lead role.

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:40.690
Eh, why are you so sure?

00:07:40.690 --> 00:07:46.440
Because my papa's company is the sponsor for that movie.

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:48.650
But that has nothing to do with it.

00:07:49.270 --> 00:07:50.270
How rude!

00:07:50.270 --> 00:07:50.760
Why don't you just...

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:52.520
Well, that's not entirely the case.

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:57.860
While, it's true that the sponsor has the power to give suggestions,

00:07:57.860 --> 00:08:00.370
the sponsor does not film the movie.

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:06.490
There's the director, the producer, and a lot of other employees that make the movie.

00:08:06.490 --> 00:08:10.590
So the sponsor can't just do whatever it wants.

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:12.620
You're Tamaki-san, right?

00:08:13.170 --> 00:08:15.370
Showbiz is not as simple as you think.

00:08:18.760 --> 00:08:21.370
If you're so certain, then just go!

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:23.310
But it'll be a waste!

00:08:23.310 --> 00:08:25.040
What's wrong with her?

00:08:25.040 --> 00:08:27.230
Onpu-chan, you'll definitely be the main actress.

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:29.210
Yup, I'll try my best.

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:29.960
I got it.

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:33.770
Let's go cheer for Onpu-chan this Sunday.

00:08:33.770 --> 00:08:36.190
Ah, that's a good idea.

00:08:36.190 --> 00:08:37.180
Let's go.

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:38.780
I'm so happy, thank you.

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:41.420
Okay then, see you later.

00:08:42.570 --> 00:08:44.580
Ah! Onpu-chan, what about cleaning duty?

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:47.250
Huh? Oh my, what should I do?

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:51.700
I have a lot to do today, like my interview...

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:55.370
The S in Souji (Cleaning).

00:08:55.370 --> 00:08:57.570
The O in Otetsudai (Helping out).

00:08:57.570 --> 00:08:58.800
The S in Shitai (Wanting to).

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:02.520
Please leave it to the SOS Trio!

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:04.280
Yay! I'm so happy!

00:09:04.280 --> 00:09:05.310
Then, please take care of it.

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:06.330
Bye-bye.

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:07.910
Bye-bye!

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:09.270
She's so cute!

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:12.680
What was that? She's pretty good.

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:15.020
What!?

00:09:15.020 --> 00:09:16.530
Segawa Onpu-chan!?

00:09:17.720 --> 00:09:18.990
I'm going too!

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:21.450
Why are you so excited?

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:23.870
You ask why?

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:29.040
I joined her Internet fan club, that's why! I'm member number 7!

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:32.380
Go! Go! Onpu!

00:09:32.380 --> 00:09:34.840
O! N! P! U!

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:37.740
We'll go by ourselves.

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:38.420
Yeah.

00:09:38.980 --> 00:09:42.400
Hey, can we go this Sunday?

00:09:42.400 --> 00:09:44.680
Well, what about the store?

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.690
I'll be fine by myself.

00:09:47.620 --> 00:09:48.490
Really?

00:09:48.490 --> 00:09:49.250
Yeah.

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:53.250
I don't have a date this Sunday.

00:09:54.640 --> 00:09:57.700
I'm fine with Pop looking after the store.

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:59.410
Go, go.

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:01.810
Your attitude changes way too easily.

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:02.990
Now, now.

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:11.290
All those auditioning for the heroine in "Love's Call," please line up here!

00:10:17.850 --> 00:10:20.820
There're so many fans like Oyajiide.

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:24.470
Not only that, but Doremi-chan hasn't come back from the bathroom yet.

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:26.180
Did something happen to her?

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:28.940
Where's Onpu-chan?

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:31.800
I wanted to cheer her on.

00:10:32.410 --> 00:10:34.440
Contestant waiting room?

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:35.850
This is it!

00:10:35.850 --> 00:10:37.150
Is she here?

00:10:40.290 --> 00:10:41.160
Ah!

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:42.510
There she is!

00:10:42.510 --> 00:10:43.910
Hey, you!

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:45.410
Hurry up and get in line, will you?

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:48.080
Well, I'm not really...

00:10:48.080 --> 00:10:49.530
Come on, come on, hurry it up.

00:10:56.680 --> 00:10:59.240
What are <i>you</i>  doing here!?

00:10:59.240 --> 00:11:00.430
You too!

00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:08.340
The heroine is chosen by audition, so I'm forced to be here.

00:11:08.340 --> 00:11:09.890
Okay, please be quiet.

00:11:11.860 --> 00:11:13.990
That was scary.

00:11:15.510 --> 00:11:25.200
But... a lot of people get scouted to become idols when they accidentally join their friends' auditions.

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:27.490
Maybe I will too!

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:53.770
What happened to Doremi-chan?

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:56.690
Maybe she got lost?

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:00.690
Okay, thank you.

00:12:05.320 --> 00:12:06.530
Doremi-chan!

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:07.660
Why's she on the stage?

00:12:08.190 --> 00:12:11.250
Number 20, you look pretty nervous.

00:12:12.910 --> 00:12:15.540
Yes, incred...ibly.

00:12:15.540 --> 00:12:18.250
Then try taking a deep breath.

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:32.440
Don't just breathe in, breathe out too! Breathe out!

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:39.880
I thought I was gonna die there.

00:12:41.770 --> 00:12:43.070
She should be fine.

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:47.030
Then please tell us your name and why you are auditioning.

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:48.020
Okay.

00:12:48.020 --> 00:12:51.170
Um, I'm number 20, Harukaze Doremi.

00:12:51.690 --> 00:12:53.920
The reason I'm auditioning is...

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:57.130
What should I do?

00:12:57.130 --> 00:13:00.170
I can't say I was lost...

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:01.700
One, two...

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:03.550
Doremi-chan, fight!

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:09.970
Thank you! My courage is back from that!

00:13:10.390 --> 00:13:12.870
Oh yeah. Uhm, uhm...!

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:15.190
I came because I love steak!

00:13:17.790 --> 00:13:18.480
Steak?

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:19.590
Yes.

00:13:19.590 --> 00:13:24.280
If I became an actress, I could eat steak every day!

00:13:25.650 --> 00:13:26.700
That's the best!

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:32.620
Then please act out a scene where you are eating a delicious steak.

00:13:33.170 --> 00:13:35.040
Okay!

00:13:35.040 --> 00:13:38.960
Are you talking about the cheap beef you get at the supermarket?

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:43.340
Or the expensive beef from a restaurant?

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:45.800
Uh... the restaurant's beef.

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:47.540
Got it!

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:50.550
This restaurant's steak...

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:57.310
Thanks for the food!

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:05.070
So good!

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:06.950
The best!

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:09.780
This is top class stuff!

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:14.500
Doremi-chan, you're the best!

00:14:18.130 --> 00:14:20.380
Number 21, Tamaki Reika.

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:22.420
I'm good at tennis.

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:25.100
Reika, do your best.

00:14:25.100 --> 00:14:27.590
Then please show some of your tennis skills.

00:14:27.590 --> 00:14:28.800
Okay.

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:31.620
I already checked the movie's script.

00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:34.390
There's a scene where the heroine plays tennis.

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:36.060
Okay!

00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:40.770
Go!

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:43.450
What beautiful form.

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:46.440
She ain't very good when she plays fer real.

00:15:06.580 --> 00:15:08.340
No wonder she's Onpu-chan.

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:09.660
She's so good.

00:15:09.660 --> 00:15:14.100
Oh ho ho ho! My Onpu-chan practices differently than other people.

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:16.560
Good job, everyone.

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:20.520
Now then, I shall now announce those who passed the first stage of the audition.

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:23.020
Number 3, Arihara-san.

00:15:23.820 --> 00:15:24.920
Number 8, Arai-san.

00:15:24.920 --> 00:15:25.480
No way!

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:27.410
Number 20, Harukaze-san.

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:30.700
I actually did it!

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:32.160
Awesome, awesome!

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:33.860
Number 21, Tamaki-san.

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:37.150
Number 35, Segawa-san.

00:15:37.150 --> 00:15:39.690
Onpu-chan!

00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:40.810
Thank you!

00:16:11.340 --> 00:16:15.700
Now then, I shall now announce those who passed the third stage of the audition.

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:18.200
Number 20, Harukaze-san.

00:16:20.010 --> 00:16:21.620
Number 21, Tamaki-san.

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:25.210
Number 35, Segawa-san.

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:26.540
Yes!

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:28.750
You're awesome, Doremi-chan.

00:16:30.310 --> 00:16:33.730
I never thought you'd make it all the way to the end!

00:16:33.730 --> 00:16:35.520
It was luck, pure luck.

00:16:36.780 --> 00:16:40.970
Well, in the end it'll only be me and Segawa-san.

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:42.980
You can't say that for sure.

00:16:44.150 --> 00:16:47.270
Okay, please change into your costumes.

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:48.720
Okay!

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:51.490
Costume?

00:16:55.260 --> 00:16:58.800
Hey, Onpu-chan, what's this about our costumes?

00:16:58.800 --> 00:16:59.830
I'm sorry.

00:17:02.710 --> 00:17:04.940
Excuse me, Mister.

00:17:04.940 --> 00:17:07.710
I can't concentrate with all this noise here.

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:11.260
Is there a more quiet room?

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:15.190
Oh, I'm not really complaining about you girls.

00:17:15.190 --> 00:17:16.200
No offense.

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:19.350
No offense, y'say?

00:17:26.610 --> 00:17:30.350
Put on your favorite costume and act out your favorite role.

00:17:30.350 --> 00:17:35.240
I shall be the winner with my Romeo and Juliet performance.

00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:38.340
Put on your favorite costume...

00:17:38.340 --> 00:17:40.480
and act out yer favorite role...

00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:41.320
Alright!

00:17:41.320 --> 00:17:42.370
If that's the case...

00:17:45.590 --> 00:17:49.440
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:17:50.420 --> 00:17:52.520
Turn into Princess Kaguya!

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:57.000
Ta-da!

00:17:58.020 --> 00:17:59.120
It's so heavy.

00:17:59.120 --> 00:18:00.970
Why Princess Kaguya?

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:01.430
Because...

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:02.730
Who cares, hurry!

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:08.410
Grandpa, Grandma, thank you for all that you've done.

00:18:08.410 --> 00:18:12.980
I shall return to the moon nooooow.

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:14.870
It's over.

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:17.360
But she did well to get here.

00:18:18.780 --> 00:18:22.430
If my Romeo has passed away,

00:18:22.430 --> 00:18:27.480
I have no reason to keep on living in this world!

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:34.530
This can't be real.

00:18:34.530 --> 00:18:35.630
That's it for her.

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:37.710
Okay, that's enough.

00:18:37.710 --> 00:18:39.710
Next up, number 35.

00:18:40.330 --> 00:18:43.100
Number 21! That's enough!

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:46.640
No way!

00:18:53.530 --> 00:18:54.440
That's...

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:04.680
Segawa-san, that costume...

00:19:05.210 --> 00:19:09.190
When I was young, I always wanted to become a witch.

00:19:09.190 --> 00:19:12.380
That's why I've decided to act out a witch's role.

00:19:15.260 --> 00:19:20.090
Pururun Purun Famifami Faa!

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:24.100
Everyone, vote for me!

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:28.970
Now I shall win.

00:19:29.780 --> 00:19:30.850
Just kidding.

00:19:31.760 --> 00:19:34.160
If only magic were actually real.

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:36.760
Number 35, Segawa Onpu.

00:19:37.310 --> 00:19:39.860
Onpu-chan!

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:42.680
Did she cast real magic?

00:19:42.680 --> 00:19:46.830
But she has the same clothes as us, and a Poron, too.

00:19:46.830 --> 00:19:50.290
Onpu-chan... Don't tell me...

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:59.040
Now then, I shall announce the main heroine for "Love's Call."

00:19:59.640 --> 00:20:02.580
The judges unanimously choose...

00:20:02.580 --> 00:20:04.720
Number 35, Segawa Onpu-san.

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:08.300
What is the meaning of this, Papa!?

00:20:08.860 --> 00:20:11.980
Well, Onpu-chan is just too cute.

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:17.860
I don't feel good.

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:18.860
Reika's going home.

00:20:18.860 --> 00:20:21.330
I'm really...

00:20:21.330 --> 00:20:25.620
I'm really the world's luckiest pretty girl!

00:20:30.390 --> 00:20:32.960
I don't think I can get up anymore.

00:20:37.720 --> 00:20:40.380
Why is Onpu-chan in a picture with Majo Rika?

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:41.720
That's not me.

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:42.510
If that's the case...

00:20:42.510 --> 00:20:46.970
I don't know who that Witch Frog is, but Onpu is very likely to be...

00:20:46.970 --> 00:20:48.770
A witch apprentice?

00:20:48.770 --> 00:20:49.310
Yes.

00:20:49.310 --> 00:20:52.350
Then she really did cast magic to make herself win!

00:20:55.010 --> 00:20:56.400
That laugh...

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:57.980
That's right!

00:20:57.980 --> 00:21:03.360
Onpu is the genius witch apprentice of me, the great and powerful Majo Ruka-sama!

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:05.580
You became a Witch Frog.

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:08.580
Why in the world are you a Witch Frog?

00:21:09.880 --> 00:21:13.030
It's because your Ojamajos are getting a pretty good reputation.

00:21:13.030 --> 00:21:15.540
I wanted to have a disciple too.

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:16.950
You liar.

00:21:16.950 --> 00:21:18.800
You got yer identity found out, didn't ya?

00:21:18.800 --> 00:21:19.880
You're trying too hard.

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:21.590
You're wrooooooooong!

00:21:22.620 --> 00:21:26.220
Your magic goods can only earn you chump change.

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:29.180
But Onpu, as a huge star, can earn me a huge bundle!

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:32.140
Majo Ruka is my company's president.

00:21:35.360 --> 00:21:41.150
As long as Onpu stays popular, I will have the funds to run for the next Queen.

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:44.110
Looks like my victory is assured, Majo Rika.

00:21:44.110 --> 00:21:45.680
Well, that's the story.

00:21:45.680 --> 00:21:47.750
Girls, I hope we can still be friends!

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:04.180
The level 4 exam is an obstacle course!

00:22:04.180 --> 00:22:05.960
I'm not confident about this at all.

00:22:05.960 --> 00:22:09.460
Don't worry, because we're racing against a tortoise and a hare!

00:22:09.460 --> 00:22:10.490
This'll be easy!

00:22:10.490 --> 00:22:11.400
What're ya talkin' about?

00:22:11.400 --> 00:22:15.380
We're goin' up against the Witch World's most hardworkin' hare and the fastest tortoise!

00:22:15.380 --> 00:22:15.710
Ehhh!?

00:22:15.710 --> 00:22:18.660
And we have to race with our fairies!

00:22:18.660 --> 00:22:19.250
Eeeehhhh!?

00:22:19.250 --> 00:22:21.780
Then I have to be with Dodo?

00:22:21.780 --> 00:22:23.480
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:23.480 --> 00:22:25.650
The Level 4 Exam is DODODODODO-!

00:22:25.650 --> 00:22:28.510
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
